Company: {{ $json.company }}
Location: {{ $json.location }} ({{ $json.work_mode }})
Salary: {{ $json.salary_min || "not stated" }} - {{ $json.salary_max || "" }} {{ $json.salary_currency }} {{ $json.salary_period }}
Description: {{ $json.description }}

TASK: Score 0-100 how well this job fits the candidate. Give 80+ only when the CV clearly covers the core requirements AND the level/location/salary conditions are met. Do not assume skills that are not written in the CV. reason_ar = one short Arabic sentence (max 25 words). meets_level = false if the job needs more seniority than the candidate has.

